/* Los cuatro arquetipos de kit: la mecánica que el campo archetype prometía.
   Diseñados en la sesión de clases-y-kits; aplicados hoy. Cada kit lleva su
   clave en "arch". Con esto, 13 de los 22 pares de dominancia entre kits
   dejan de ser comparables: dos kits con mecánica distinta ya no se ordenan. */
/* ══════════ ANCESTRY ══════════
   Three mandatory steps at creation. Bonuses add; nothing caps them.
   Step 1 primordial (fixed) · step 2 reinforce / second-generation race / custom ·
   step 3 reinforce / third-generation race / custom. */
GAMEDATA.ancestryRules = {
  "steps": "Three steps, all mandatory. 1: a primordial race, fixed bonuses. 2: reinforce your primordial, take a second-generation race, or build a custom bonus. 3: reinforce your current line, take a third-generation race, or build a custom ability.",
  "reinforce": "Reinforcing means choosing the same race again: in step 2 it gives that race's reinforce bonus; in step 3 it gives that race's ability. If step 2 was custom, step 3 reinforces the primordial.",
  "stacking": "All bonuses add to the base and kit numbers. Vitality, Echo, Aen per turn, movement and Echo charges can all go up; no cap.",
  "social": "A social advantage means you roll 2d20 and keep the higher on that kind of check. It never adds damage.",
  "ability": "Step-3 abilities cost 1 Aen, once per encounter, on your turn. They are not reactions and do not use your reaction slot."
};
